SUMMARY IN ENGLISH

This repository contains a literary work and the program that publishes it.
They are NOT under the same terms.

* Texts, PDFs and audio (`src/content/`, `public/nada/`, `public/audio/`)
  are © Zalia Sékaï, ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. Quoting is allowed provided the
  author and source are credited. Reproduction, republication, translation,
  adaptation, commercial use and use as machine-learning training data all
  require her prior written permission. Public visibility on GitHub, and the
  right to view and fork granted by GitHub's Terms of Service, convey no
  further rights whatsoever.

* Third-party material (press clippings, photographs by others, posters,
  book covers) belongs to its respective rights holders and is reproduced
  here for critical and documentary purposes only.

* The site's source code is MIT-licensed, © 2026 Laurent Marissal. The MIT
  licence covers the code ONLY.
